  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Ji-Wan and Hee-Woo are two wealthy, good-looking twenty-six-year-olds from elite Korean families. Despite their perfect appearances, each carries a fatal flaw. Ji-Wan lives recklessly, addicted to luxury and excess, while Hee-Woo drifts through life numb and uninterested in anything around him. When Ji-Wan’s father suddenly cuts off his credit cards, his lavish world collapses overnight. Desperate to afford a limited-edition coat he refuses to give up, Ji-Wan turns to a supposedly easy, high-paying side job at a secretive private club and convinces his childhood friend Hee-Woo to join him. Expecting nothing more than pouring drinks and entertaining guests, Ji-Wan instead finds himself pulled into situations far beyond his control, while Hee-Woo, long bored with life, begins to awaken to a dangerous new thrill.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Bimilkeulleom Danpyeonseon (비밀클럽 단편선) Collection.*",
